[node name="drop" type="Marker3D" parent="water/CW-AQ"]
editor_description = "D2's built drop (Christina, 2026-10-16: \"Old levels + a drop\"), editor-owned: the marker is the crest, on the creek's course between p03 and p04. Above it the creek keeps its old levels; crest is its bed there in world metres. Below it a stepped cascade of steps steps, run metres long along the course, falls into a plunge pool that reaches the last reach's head (p04), its bed pool_depth metres under p04's level. tools/gen_props.gd builds the crest sill, steps, side walls, water and the pool's cut in the made ground from these."
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, -68.08, 0, 48.56)
metadata/crest = -2.946
metadata/steps = 4
metadata/run = 1.2
metadata/pool_depth = 0.5

[node name="pond" type="Marker3D" parent="water/CW-AQ"]
editor_description = "D2's rain pond (editor-owned since 2026-10-16): the marker is the pond's centre; radii are the water's half extents and bank_radii the planted bank's, x and z, in world metres; water and bed are its levels in world metres. tools/gen_props.gd builds the water, the bank and the basin cut in the made ground from them. Moved off the Grand Circuit lane to the shore-level ground between the lane, S2 and B's return, long axis north-south (Christina, 2026-10-16: \"Culvert D2\"; the maps at e7037ac)."
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, -75, 0, 58.77)
metadata/radii = Vector2(4, 7)
metadata/bank_radii = Vector2(7, 10)
metadata/water = -6.85
metadata/bed = -7.45

[node name="CB1" type="Marker3D" parent="water/CW-AQ"]
editor_description = "CB1, the pond garden footbridge (editor-owned since 2026-10-16): the marker is the deck's centre, turned about y to the way its walk crosses; size is the deck's (across, along) in world metres and guard_inset how far each guard rail stops short of its ends. Re-sited across the pond's north end, east-west, closing the pond garden loop (Christina, 2026-10-16: \"Approve, commit, build\")."
transform = Transform3D(-4.371139e-08, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, -1, 0, -4.371139e-08, -75, 0, 57.16)
metadata/size = Vector2(4, 11)
metadata/guard_inset = 0.2

[node name="CB2" type="Marker3D" parent="water/CW-AQ"]
editor_description = "CB2, route B's promenade bridge over D2 (editor-owned since 2026-10-16): the marker is the deck's centre, turned about y to the way B crosses; size is the deck's (across, along) in world metres and guard_inset how far each guard rail stops short of its ends. Moved with the creek's notch to (-96, 47), 10 x 6 (Christina, 2026-10-16: \"Culvert D2\")."
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, -96, 0, 47)
metadata/size = Vector2(10, 6)
metadata/guard_inset = 0.7

[node name="garden" type="Node3D" parent="water/CW-AQ"]
editor_description = "The pond garden loop, the funhouse garden loop re-sited (Christina, 2026-10-16: \"Approve, commit, build\"), editor-owned: a garden walk width metres wide on the pond's bank. loop runs from CB1's east end south round the pond to CB1's west end, and CB1 closes it; stem leaves route B's south return at its first marker and meets the loop at its last. tools/gen_props.gd lays the walks at the bank's level, the stem graded from B's level, and opens B's guard where the stem leaves it."
metadata/width = 2.6

